$ tool --help
Copies files around.

Usage: tool [options] <command>

Options:
  -v, --verbose      Say more
      --dry-run      Change nothing
  -o, --output FILE  Where to write (default: out.txt)
  -j, --jobs N       How many at once
  -h, --help         Show this help

Commands:
  build  Build a target
  test   Run the tests

Run 'tool <command> --help' for the options of a command.
$ tool build --help
Build a target

Usage: tool build [options] <target> [mode] [more]...

Arguments:
  target  What to build
  mode    How
  more    Other targets

Options:
  -r, --release  Optimise
  -l, --level N  Level (required)
  -h, --help     Show this help
$ tool -h build
Copies files around.

Usage: tool [options] <command>

Options:
  -v, --verbose      Say more
      --dry-run      Change nothing
  -o, --output FILE  Where to write (default: out.txt)
  -j, --jobs N       How many at once
  -h, --help         Show this help

Commands:
  build  Build a target
  test   Run the tests

Run 'tool <command> --help' for the options of a command.
$ tool test
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no command=test target=- mode=- more= release=no level=- sees-verbose=no 
$ tool -vvv --dry-run -ofile --jobs=4 test
verbose=3 output=file dry=yes jobs=4 command=test target=- mode=- more= release=no level=- sees-verbose=yes 
$ tool -v -o x --output y -j 2 build a b c d -r -l=3
verbose=1 output=y dry=no jobs=2 command=build target=a mode=b more=c+d release=yes level=3 sees-verbose=yes 
$ tool build a --level -1
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no command=build target=a mode=- more= release=no level=-1 sees-verbose=no 
$ tool build a --level 2 -- -x --y
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no command=build target=a mode=-x more=--y release=no level=2 sees-verbose=no 
$ tool build -1 - --level 2
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no command=build target=-1 mode=- more= release=no level=2 sees-verbose=no 
$ tool build a -l2 -rl3
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no command=build target=a mode=- more= release=yes level=3 sees-verbose=no 
$ tool --verbos test
error: unknown option '--verbos'. Did you mean '--verbose'? | --verbos | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool --zzzzzz test
error: unknown option '--zzzzzz'. | --zzzzzz | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool -x test
error: unknown option '-x'. | -x | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool --verbose=1 test
error: the flag '--verbose' doesn't take a value; remove '=1' | --verbose | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool --output
error: the option '--output' needs a value: --output FILE | --output | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool -o
error: the option '-o' needs a value: -o FILE | -o | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool bild
error: unknown command 'bild'. Did you mean 'build'? The commands are: build, test | bild | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool zzzzzz
error: unknown command 'zzzzzz'. The commands are: build, test | zzzzzz | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool 
error: a command is missing: build, test | command | Try 'tool --help'.
$ tool build
error: the option '--level' is required: --level N | --level | Try 'tool build --help'.
$ tool build a
error: the option '--level' is required: --level N | --level | Try 'tool build --help'.
$ tool test extra
error: unexpected argument 'extra'. Usage: tool test [options] | extra | Try 'tool test --help'.
$ tool -j abc test
verbose=0 output=out.txt dry=no error: 'jobs' must be a whole number, not 'abc' | jobs | Try 'tool --help'.
